        "TileImage": "$($repository b542b0fe-36d2-4cde-88ff-345acf95909c).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47.\rMorocco is in turmoil, nearing a civil war, and the situation hasn&apos;t gone any better ever since that prison break orchestrated by General Zaydan and his crew of coupsters.\r\rA hit has been called by a rival political faction in the country called the Front of Liberation for the People of Morocco, they ask that we dispose of some of the men within the ranks of the Reza Association. They have been known to operate in the defunct school in Marrakesh.\r\rGood Luck!",
